{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "KJV1769",
  "book_code": "1PE",
  "chapter": 2,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wherefore laying aside all malice, and all guile, and hypocrisies, and envies, and all evil speakings,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As newborn babes, desire the sincere milk of the word, that ye may grow thereby:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If so be ye have tasted that the Lord ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " gracious.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To whom coming, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "as unto",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a living stone, disallowed indeed of men, but chosen of God, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " precious,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ye also, as lively stones, are built up a spiritual house, an holy priesthood, to offer up spiritual sacrifices, acceptable to God by Jesus Christ.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wherefore also it is contained in the scripture, Behold, I lay in Sion a chief corner stone, elect, precious: and he that believeth on him shall not be confounded.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Unto you therefore which believe ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "he is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " precious: but unto them which be disobedient, the stone which the builders disallowed, the same is made the head of the corner,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And a stone of stumbling, and a rock of offence, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even to them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " which stumble at the word, being disobedient: whereunto also they were appointed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But ye ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a chosen generation, a royal priesthood, an holy nation, a peculiar people; that ye should shew forth the praises of him who hath called you out of darkness into his marvellous light:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Which in time past ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not a people, but ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " now the people of God: which had not obtained mercy, but now have obtained mercy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Dearly beloved, I beseech ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "you",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " as strangers and pilgrims, abstain from fleshly lusts, which war against the soul;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Having your conversation honest among the Gentiles: that, whereas they speak against you as evildoers, they may by ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "your",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " good works, which they shall behold, glorify God in the day of visitation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Submit yourselves to every ordinance of man for the Lord’s sake: whether it be to the king, as supreme;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Or unto governors, as unto them that are sent by him for the punishment of evildoers, and for the praise of them that do well.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For so is the will of God, that with well doing ye may put to silence the ignorance of foolish men:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As free, and not using ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "your",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " liberty for a cloke of maliciousness, but as the servants of God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Honour all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "men",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ". Love the brotherhood. Fear God. Honour the king.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Servants, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " subject to ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "your",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " masters with all fear; not only to the good and gentle, but also to the froward.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For this ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thankworthy, if a man for conscience toward God endure grief, suffering wrongfully.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For what glory ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", if, when ye be buffeted for your faults, ye shall take it patiently? but if, when ye do well, and suffer ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "for it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", ye take it patiently, this ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " acceptable with God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For even hereunto were ye called: because Christ also suffered for us, leaving us an example, that ye should follow his steps:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who did no sin, neither was guile found in his mouth:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who, when he was reviled, reviled not again; when he suffered, he threatened not; but committed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "himself",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to him that judgeth righteously:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who his own self bare our sins in his own body on the tree, that we, being dead to sins, should live unto righteousness: by whose stripes ye were healed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.2.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1PE.2.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For ye were as sheep going astray; but are now returned unto the Shepherd and Bishop of your souls.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
